ee heaven open, and the angels of God ascending and descending upon the Son of man.", "words": [[0, 312975], [4, 313103], [7, 313203], [12, 313423], [15, 313603], [20, 314828], [25, 315045], [36, 315725], [38, 315865], [42, 316105], [45, 316325], [50, 317005], [60, 317525], [64, 317805], [70, 317985], [74, 318205], [81, 318465], [87, 319465], [91, 319545], [95, 319665], [102, 320085], [105, 320265], [109, 320545], [119, 321125], [123, 321345], [134, 321785], [139, 322105], [143, 322365], [147, 322565], [150, 322705]]}]}